        --bind 127.0.0.1
      - bridge/jellyfin.py: JELLYFIN_WEB_HOST = "127.0.0.1" (panel
        uses 127.0.0.1 even though Jellyfin itself defaults to 0.0.0.0)
      - bridge/photos.py, bridge/remotefs.py, bridge/mining.py: no
        web listeners (they manage systemd services, not web servers)
  * VERSION SYNC. All release surfaces report v0.0.41.

