    freshly-installed code. v0.0.24 uninstall now removes:
      * /usr/share/cockpit/sysdeck/        (v0.0.9-v0.0.19 single-plugin)
      * /usr/share/cockpit/sysdeck-*/      (v0.0.20+ multi-plugin)
